      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Over one hundred students studying in Pakistan, Tanzania and Kenya have participated in the Introduction to Academic Writing course offered by ELE_net in 2017. The aim of this course is to enable first year students at AKU, or students who lack confidence in their writing skills, to gain an awareness and understanding of some of the key features of academic writing. Academic writing at university is very different from other types of English writing students may have done in the past. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
